# The shape of the state a nest vertex stores, and the identity each type is read back under.
#
# This file changing means bytes already written no longer describe the types that will read them.
# A field added here is absent from every entry stored before it, and reads back as null, 0 or false
# with nothing thrown and nothing logged. Updating this file is the moment to decide which case it is:
#
#   - the absent value is safe for every field added, or
#   - the serialVersionUID is bumped, so old bytes are refused outright instead of quietly misread.
#
# Records are listed too. Their identity does not move when their components change, so this file is
# the only thing that notices when one of them gains a field.

